<title>FRANCE: AGF says would look at GAN if up for sale.</title>
<headline>AGF says would look at GAN if up for sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer AGF said on Thursday it would study GAN's insurance operations if the company were put up for sale.</p>
<p>&quot;I will study the dossier using the criteria of its profitability,&quot; the company's finance director, Laurent Mignon, said. &quot;At the moment, in any case, GAN is not for sale.&quot;</p>
</text>
